          "type": "EMaterialQualityLevel::Type"
        },
        {
          "name": "In Feature Level",
          "type": "ERHIFeatureLevel::Type"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "A Map that gives the (smallest) texture coordinate scale used when sampling each texture register of a shader.\nThe array index is the register index, and the value, is the coordinate scale.\nSince a texture resource can be bound to several texture registers, it can related to different indices.\nThis is reflected in UMaterialInterface::GetUsedTexturesAndIndices where each texture is bound to\nan array of texture register indices."
    },
